# MAXScript and ini files are deployed byte-for-byte into 3ds Max; git must
# never rewrite their line endings (the tree is deliberately mixed CRLF/LF
# and both shapes are proven in the field).  These -text rules must come
# AFTER the catch-all below: last matching pattern wins.
* text=auto

*.ms -text
*.mcr -text
*.ini -text
*.bat -text
